    <node id="&quot;GILBERT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gilbert is a filmmaker whose body of work is being re-evaluated due to newly discovered Iranian citizenship, indicating a rich and complex legacy."</data>
